WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Bu qismda yana ikki turdagi tenglamani ko‘ramiz.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:11.520
Birinchisida y va uning barcha hosilalarini bir xil songa ko‘paytirsak, tenglama o‘zgarmaydi.

3
00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:18.048
Ikkinchisida x va y ga turli “vaznlar” berib, barcha hadlarni tenglashtiramiz.

4
00:00:18.048 --> 00:00:22.022
Ikkala holda tartib bittaga pasayadi.

5
00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:28.896
Agar tenglama y, y shtrix, y ikki shtrixga nisbatan bir jinsli bo‘lsa,

6
00:00:28.896 --> 00:00:34.056
y shtrix teng y ko‘paytirilgan z almashtirishni qilamiz.

7
00:00:34.056 --> 00:00:40.008
Unda y ikki shtrix teng y ko‘paytirilgan z shtrix qo‘shuv z kvadrat.

8
00:00:40.008 --> 00:00:46.104
y ning darajasiga qisqartirsak, z uchun birinchi tartibli tenglama qoladi.

9
00:00:46.104 --> 00:00:51.086
Diqqat: bu “bir jinsli” so‘zining yana bir ma’nosi.

10
00:00:51.336 --> 00:00:58.896
Misol: x y y ikki shtrix minus x y shtrix kvadrat teng y y shtrix.

11
00:00:58.896 --> 00:01:03.216
Har bir had y ga nisbatan ikkinchi darajali.

12
00:01:03.216 --> 00:01:09.912
Almashtirishdan keyin y kvadratga qisqartiramiz va x z shtrix teng z ni olamiz.

13
00:01:09.912 --> 00:01:13.094
Demak z teng C bir x.

14
00:01:13.344 --> 00:01:17.832
Endi y shtrix bo‘lingan y teng C bir x.

15
00:01:17.832 --> 00:01:24.696
Integrallasak, y teng C ikki ko‘paytirilgan e daraja C bir x kvadratning yarmi.

16
00:01:24.696 --> 00:01:29.640
C ikki nolga teng bo‘lganda y aynan nol ham yechim.

17
00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:33.902
Natijani tenglamaga qo‘yib tekshirish oson.

18
00:01:34.152 --> 00:01:38.400
Endi x ga vazn bir, y ga vazn m beramiz.

19
00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:44.520
Unda y shtrixning vazni m minus bir, y ikki shtrixniki m minus ikki.

20
00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:52.392
x kub y ikki shtrix tenglamasi, x y shtrix minus y ning kvadrati bilan solishtirilsa,

21
00:01:52.392 --> 00:01:56.088
m qo‘shuv bir teng ikki m, ya’ni m teng bir.

22
00:01:56.088 --> 00:02:03.182
x teng e daraja t, y teng e daraja t ko‘paytirilgan u almashtirish t ni yo‘qotadi.

23
00:02:03.432 --> 00:02:07.008
Oxirgi tenglamada t ham, u ham yo‘q,

24
00:02:07.008 --> 00:02:13.008
shuning uchun q teng u ning hosilasi deymiz va ajraladigan tenglama olamiz.

25
00:02:13.008 --> 00:02:20.160
Javob: y teng x ln x minus x ln modul bir minus C bir x qo‘shuv C ikki x.

26
00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:27.830
Shuningdek, q nol bo‘lgan holat y teng C x yechimini beradi — uni alohida yozish kerak.

27
00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:37.440
Grafikda birinchi misoldagi y teng e daraja C bir x kvadrat yarmi egri chiziqlari C bir ning uchta qiymatida ko‘rsatilgan.

28
00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:43.920
C bir musbat bo‘lsa egri chiziq o‘sadi, manfiy bo‘lsa — qo‘ng‘iroq shaklida so‘nadi,

29
00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:47.510
nol bo‘lsa — gorizontal chiziq.

30
00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:51.840
O‘zingizni tekshiring: y, y shtrix,

31
00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:57.960
y ikki shtrixga nisbatan bir jinsli tenglama uchun qaysi almashtirish to‘g‘ri?

32
00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:00.566
Javobni tanlang.
